## Hook Reference

### usePopup

```typescript
const {
  visible,     // boolean - whether popup is shown
  position,    // { x, y } - screen coordinates
  annotation,  // Annotation | null - associated annotation
  show,        // (position, annotation) => void
  hide,        // () => void
