## Tools

### Activating a Tool

<Tabs>
  <TabItem label="React">
    ```tsx
    import { useTool } from "annota";
    import { RectangleTool } from "annota";

    function ToolController({ viewer }) {
      const tool = new RectangleTool();

      useTool({
        viewer,
        handler: tool,
        enabled: true,
